# Layout density & readable panels

**Desktop only (`desktop-ui/`).** Mobile layout lives in `mobile-ui/` — see `.cursor/rules/mobile-vs-desktop.mdc` and `.cursor/rules/mobile-simplicity.mdc`. Do not apply these patterns to mobile.

Use these patterns whenever a tab mixes **filters + summary table + long card list** (Portfolio 24h, opportunities, dashboards).

## Panel stack (required for full-height tabs)

```tsx
<div className="panel-stack flex-1 min-h-0">
  <div className="panel-stack-pin …">  {/* filters, KPI table, summary strip — shrink-0 */}
  <div className="panel-stack-scroll …">  {/* detail cards — sole vertical scroll */}
</div>
```

- Parent chain must include `flex flex-col flex-1 min-h-0 overflow-hidden`.
- Never put tables and cards in the **same** `overflow-y-auto` without pinning the table.

## Tables in the pin zone

- Wrap wide tables in `panel-table-scroll` (max ~38vh / 260px, internal scroll).
- Default **collapsed** or capped height when row count > ~5 (opportunities profile).
- Table body: `text-[10px]`; company/name columns: `truncate` + `max-w-[88px]`.
- P&L ticker table: class `portfolio-pnl-sheet-table` — sticky header, `min-width: 54rem`, cell padding ≥ 0.5rem, P&L %/€ stacked with `gap-1`, colors via `rgb(var(--signal-up/down))`.

## Text & labels

- Page subtitles: `ui-subtitle-clamp` (max 2 lines) + full text in `title`.
- Toolbar hints: `ui-caption-clamp` (1 line) + `title` tooltip.
- Chips: short labels; long copy only in `title` / tooltip.
- Hero metrics in dense lists: `PlanProbHero variant="compact"` or `"table"`, not `"hero"`.

## Anti-patterns

- `ResponsiveContainer height="100%"` without explicit pixel height on parent.
- `flex-1` children without `min-h-0` (breaks scroll).
- Unbounded table height above scrollable content.
- `text-xl` / `text-lg` in summary strips or multi-row toolbars.
